OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F386A1786133895
OL,3,CInvestigating officer 'appalled' Pc
OL,4,CHarper's killers could be released
OL,5,Cearly
OL,7,FThe police detective who led the
OL,8,Finvestigation into the death of Pc
OL,9,FAndrew Harper said he is "appalled"
OL,10,Ftwo men convicted of his manslaughter
OL,11,Fcould be eligible for early release.
OL,13,FPc Harper sustained fatal injuries
OL,14,Fafter getting caught in a strap
OL,15,Fattached to the back of a car and
OL,16,Fbeing dragged down a country road as
OL,17,Fthe killers fled the scene of a quad
OL,18,Fbike theft in Sulhamstead, Berkshire,
OL,19,Fin 2019.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/7
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
