OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,387,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38602
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F386A1786133895
OL,3,CInvestigating officer 'appalled' Pc
OL,4,CHarper's killers could be released
OL,5,Cearly
OL,7,FJessie Cole and Albert Bowers could be
OL,8,Ffreed halfway through their 13-year
OL,9,Fsentences under Government plans for
OL,10,Fearly releases designed to tackle
OL,11,Fovercrowding in jails.
OL,13,FDetective Superintendent Stuart Blaik
OL,14,Fsaid he was "deeply concerned and
OL,15,Fappalled" by the prospect and that
OL,16,FCole and Bowers should "not be
OL,17,Fafforded the opportunity" of early
OL,18,Frelease.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/7
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,387,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38603
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F386A1786133895
OL,3,CInvestigating officer 'appalled' Pc
OL,4,CHarper's killers could be released
OL,5,Cearly
OL,7,FHe said: "Neither of them showed any
OL,8,Fremorse during their time in police
OL,9,Fcustody or during their subsequent
OL,10,Ftrial.
OL,12,F"I hope the Government takes account
OL,13,Fof the strength of public feeling on
OL,14,Fthis issue, which has been both clear
OL,15,Fand widespread,"
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/7
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,387,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38604
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F386A1786133895
OL,3,CInvestigating officer 'appalled' Pc
OL,4,CHarper's killers could be released
OL,5,Cearly
OL,7,FThe Government has resisted pressure
OL,8,Fto exempt the two men from the early
OL,9,Frelease scheme, part of the Sentencing
OL,10,FAct passed earlier this year which cut
OL,11,Fthe minimum amount of time many
OL,12,Foffenders would have to spend in
OL,13,Fprison.
OL,15,FThames Valley Police Chief Constable
OL,16,FJason Hogg said he was receiving legal
OL,17,Fadvice on whether the force could join
OL,18,Fa legal challenge mooted by local
OL,19,FPolice Federation chief Aileen
OL,20,FO'Connor to prevent Cole and Bowers
OL,21,Fbeing freed.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G4/7
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,387,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38605
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F386A1786133895
OL,3,CInvestigating officer 'appalled' Pc
OL,4,CHarper's killers could be released
OL,5,Cearly
OL,7,FThe officer's widow Lissie Harper said
OL,8,Fthe Government "has punched us in the
OL,9,Fgut... they should be ashamed of
OL,10,Fthemselves".
OL,12,F"Hopefully we can make the current
OL,13,FGovernment come to their senses and
OL,14,Frealise we cannot put people like this
OL,15,Fback on our streets.
OL,17,F"Justice should mean justice and
OL,18,Fserving the sentence given," she said.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G5/7
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,387,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38606
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F386A1786133895
OL,3,CInvestigating officer 'appalled' Pc
OL,4,CHarper's killers could be released
OL,5,Cearly
OL,7,FThe Prime Minister has said he wanted
OL,8,Fto "go further" with the exemptions
OL,9,Fafter ordering a review of the scheme,
OL,10,Fbut this was "not possible without the
OL,11,Fprison system reaching capacity and
OL,12,Fcollapsing".
OL,14,FThose released will face tougher
OL,15,Fprobation conditions, including
OL,16,Felectronic monitoring, random drug
OL,17,Ftesting and possible bans from
OL,18,Fdriving, pubs and events such as
OL,19,Ffootball matches.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G6/7
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,387,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38607
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F386A1786133895
OL,3,CInvestigating officer 'appalled' Pc
OL,4,CHarper's killers could be released
OL,5,Cearly
OL,7,FThe driver of the vehicle, Henry Long,
OL,8,Freceived a 16-year sentence and will
OL,9,Fnot be eligible for release under the
OL,10,Fscheme.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G7/7
